---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SystemDiagram from '../components/SystemDiagram.astro';
---

<Base
  title="How it Works"
  description="How an AI agent researches and publishes sector reports on generative AI adoption in Aotearoa New Zealand."
>
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="font-display reveal text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        How it works
      </h1>
      <div class="article-prose reveal reveal-1 mt-8">
        <p>
          An AI agent keeps this site up to date. For each sector it searches the
          web for recent news, research, and case studies, then writes a fresh
          version of the report with its sources cited inline. Every update is
          opened as a pull request on GitHub, so the community can review the
          changes before they go live.
        </p>
        <p>
          Previous versions of each report are archived automatically, so you can
          always trace how the content has evolved over time. The whole system —
          prompts, agent code, and workflows — is open source: explore the
          <a href="https://github.com/mingnz/livingwp">GitHub repository</a> to
          see how it works or to contribute.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <SystemDiagram />
  </section>
</Base>
